    {"no": "26", "title": "Mode of approach", "title_hi": "पहुँचने का माध्यम", "page": 4, "fields": [], "tables": [], "text": "The lighthouse is accessible by train or by bus up to Alappuzha."},
    {"no": "27", "title": "Facilities available", "title_hi": "उपलब्ध सुविधाए", "page": 4, "fields": [], "tables": [], "text": "The Alappuzha Lighthouse located near the district headquarters of Alappuzha District has all the essential amenities within a radius of 3 K.M. Alappuzha Railway Station, Alappuzha Head Post Office, Alappuzha Civil Station/ Collectorate, Alappuzha District Police headquarters and Alappuzha South Police Station are within 2 K.M. from the lighthouse. A State Government General Hospital is only 2.5 K.M. away from the lighthouse."},
